    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0191" n="106" xml:id="pg106"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2127: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at Santo
                        Domingo</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Edwards</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Temporarily in Charge of the Legation in the Dominican Republic</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-04-24T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24, 1919,
                                4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Cable Department immediately present situation as to banditry in Santo Domingo,
                    stating whether or not it is on the increase and giving facts and dates to
                    substantiate statement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
